body:
18fbc4b86ac9fb84fb370c68b9a60d9b70cafa66 introduced this bug.

Previously it did

``` javascript
process.on("exit", function() {
    process.exit(exitCode);
});
```

Where as now it does

``` javascript
process.exitCode = exitCode
```

The former accounted for the async nature of <code>--stdin</code> where as the latter does not.
